+	help
+	  Say Y here to support the fan controller of the inMusic AZ01
+	  motorized players (Denon DJ SC5000M and SC6000M). A microcontroller
+	  on a UART runs the fans; this driver sets their level as a thermal
+	  cooling device and reports two fan readings through hwmon.
+
+	  If built as a module, it will be called az01-fan.
